Domain Entity StateEducationAgency based on EducationOrganization
    documentation "This entity represents the agency of the state charged with the primary responsibility for coordinating and supervising public instruction, including the setting of standards for elementary and secondary instructional programs."
    integer StateEducationAgencyId
        documentation "The identifier assigned to a state education agency. It must be distinct from any other identifier assigned to educational organizations, such as a LocalEducationAgencyId, to prevent duplication."
        renames identity property EducationOrganizationId
        is queryable field
        min value big
    common StateEducationAgencyAccountability
        documentation "This entity maintains information about federal reporting and accountability for state education agencies."
        is optional collection
    common StateEducationAgencyFederalFunds
        documentation "Contains the information about the reception and use of federal funds for reporting purposes."
        is optional collection
    descriptor FederalLocaleCode
        documentation "The federal locale code associated with an education organization."
        is optional